 Congressman Shri Thanedar and colleagues oppose ICE's electric shock glove plan.  They warn of potential misuse and severe injury or death from these devices.  Lawmakers cite ICE's past record and insufficient training for officers.  The proposed procurement involves millions of dollars for thousands of gloves.  They implore the Homeland Security Secretary to immediately stop this purchase.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/could-result-in-injury-or-death-thanedar-urges-us-to-halt-ices-electric-shock-glove-plan/articleshow/133433897.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/could-result-in-injury-or-death-thanedar-urges-us-to-halt-ices-electric-shock-glove-plan/articleshow/133433897.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-23T09:26:19+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133434005,imgsize-754290.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Mexican governor seeks leave again amid backlash after return following US drug charges indictment]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133433847.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/mexican-governor-seeks-leave-again-amid-backlash-after-return-following-us-drug-charges-indictment/articleshow/133433847.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/mexican-governor-seeks-leave-again-amid-backlash-after-return-following-us-drug-charges-indictment/articleshow/133433847.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-23T09:07:23+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133433888,imgsize-1019779.cms"/></item><item><title>